{"id":"641228","name":"香葱炒馒头","author":"为自己取个独一无二的昵","authorId":"10807931","desc":"","cover":"images/641228/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白馒头","amount":"两个"}],"sub":[{"name":"小葱","amount":"两根"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备白馒头两个。","img":"images/641228/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"两根小葱切碎备用。","img":"images/641228/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"馒头切成2-3厘米见方待用。","img":"images/641228/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切好的馒头装盘备用。","img":"images/641228/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"准备一个小碗，放一勺盐，再加小半碗水。","img":"images/641228/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅里放油加热。","img":"images/641228/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入馒头。","img":"images/641228/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"翻炒一分钟。","img":"images/641228/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"像这样用手在碗里撩一点水。","img":"images/641228/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"把手上的水甩在锅里馒头上面。","img":"images/641228/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"这样反复几次，边炒边撩盐水在锅里。","img":"images/641228/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"反复几次，盐水没有了，馒头就是这样。","img":"images/641228/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"最后放入葱花。","img":"images/641228/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"翻炒几次可以出锅了。","img":"images/641228/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品，香喷喷的炒馒头出锅了。","img":"images/641228/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}